{"id":"z01-16","volume":1,"volumeTitle":"周纪一","volumeSubtitle":"前385","index":16,"title":{"t":"安王十七年","s":"安王十七年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀一 · 前385 · 丙申","s":"周纪一 · 前385 · 丙申"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国的庶长改到河西迎接献公，拥立他做国君；又杀掉出子和他的母亲，把他们沉在深渊旁边。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"庶","s":"庶","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"長","s":"长","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"改","s":"改","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"迎","s":"迎","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"獻","s":"献","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"于","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"河","s":"河","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"西","s":"西","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"殺","s":"杀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"出","s":"出","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"及","s":"及","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"母","s":"母","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"沉","s":"沉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"淵","s":"渊","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"旁","s":"旁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"齐国发动军队，进攻鲁国。","tokens":[{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魯","s":"鲁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"韩国攻打郑国，夺取了阳城；又攻打宋国，把宋公捉住了。","tokens":[{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鄭","s":"郑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陽","s":"阳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"城","s":"城","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宋","s":"宋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"執","s":"执","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宋","s":"宋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"齐太公去世，他的儿子桓公午继位。","tokens":[{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"桓","s":"桓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"午","s":"午","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周安王十七年，公元前385年。秦国发生政变：庶长改从河西迎回献公，杀掉年少的出子和他的母亲。出子就是安王十五年继位的出公。齐国攻鲁。韩国从郑国手里拿下阳城，又攻宋，捉住宋公。齐太公去世，儿子午继位，称桓公。这个太公就是田和，上一年刚被周王封为诸侯。这个桓公不是春秋时姜姓的齐桓公。","theme":"秦国的君位被武力改换，献公上台，出子母子被杀并沉入水边，写法很重。齐国则是田和去世，儿子午按常例继位，田齐进入第二代。韩对郑、对宋都有战果：阳城到手，宋公被执。四国的事放在同一年，秦国这一条最惨。","technique":"第一句先写迎立，再写杀害，动词从迎、立转到杀、沉。第二句短到没有结果。第三句两个伐，各有一个战果，取和执不同。第四句回到薨和子某立的套式。没有对话，也没有评论。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"庶长","reading":"shù zhǎng","note":"秦国的官名。改是这位庶长的名。"},{"word":"迎","reading":"yíng","note":"到河西把献公接回来。"},{"word":"沉","reading":"chén","note":"沉到水里。地点在渊旁。"},{"word":"渊","reading":"yuān","note":"深水。渊旁是深水边上。"},{"word":"执","reading":"zhí","note":"捉住。韩把宋公抓住了。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"其","reading":"qí","note":"及其母的其，指出子。"},{"word":"而","reading":"ér","note":"连接迎和立，接回来并且立他为君。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"执","note":"拘捕、捉住，不是手里拿着一件器物。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"立","reading":"lì","note":"拥立。庶长改把献公立为秦君。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"沉之渊旁","note":"之指出子和他的母亲。渊旁是处所，中间没有再用于。"}]}}
